data: {"id": "c170d8c7221148fb-thinking-parallel_evidence-937", "run_id": "c170d8c7221148fb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已确认 Pod 身份并采集到关键日志证据。\n\n**身份确认**\nPod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8` (UID: `08e11260-3505-495c-8224-2b91f27f029c`)，调度在 `node2`。\n\n**事实证据**\n1. **运行状态矛盾**：`kubectl_describe` 显示当前状态为 **Running**，但 Reason 仍保留 `CrashLoopBackOff` 警告。这表明 Pod 刚刚经历了一次重启或恢复尝试，其之前的崩溃历史导致了 CrashLoopBackOff 状态的延续。\n2. **崩溃原因**：`kubectl_previous_logs`（获取上一次崩溃容器的日志）明确显示应用进程在接收到请求时发生退出：\n   - 日志：`\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process exiting\"`\n   - 路径：`/work`\n   - HTTP 状态：`500`\n   - 这是一个典型的内部应用逻", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789070796748, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

