data: {"id": "c170d8c7221148fb-thinking-parallel_evidence-2103", "run_id": "c170d8c7221148fb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，对 Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8` 的分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **实体身份**：Pod `workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8` 运行在 `node2` (IP `172.16.104.6`)，UID `08e11260-3505-495c-8224-2b91f27f029c`。\n*   **当前状态**：**已恢复 (Recovered)**。\n    *   **kubectl_get_yaml** 确认当前容器状态为 `Running` 且 `Ready: true`，启动时间为 `2026-09-10T20:07:04Z`。\n    *   **kubectl_get_by_name** 确认重启次数为 **23次**，距上次重启约 5 分钟。\n    *   **冲突事实**：**kubectl_describe** 显示 Kubelet 记录的重启计数为 **406次** 且原因标记为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。这与 YAML 中的", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 9, "ts_ms": 1789070891140, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

